1
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,900
各就各位 准备开赛
On your mark, get ready to race

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,050
一 二 三 一起飙速
One, two, three let's blaze!

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:09,130
那就扣上安全带
So buckle your seat belt

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,930
我们要尖叫呐喊
We're gonna scream and yell

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,010
飙速会拯救我们
When Blaze goes saving the day

6
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:14,180
飙速 飙速 飙速
Blaze! Blaze! Blaze!

7
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,380
给我给我给我速度
Gimme, gimme, gimme some speed!

8
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,850
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

9
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:20,610
向前冲 飙速
Go, go!  (Blaze!)

10
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:23,100
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:23,940
向前冲 飙速
Go, go!  (Blaze!)

12
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,500
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,080
向前冲 一起飙速
Go, go! Let's Blaze!

14
00:00:31,055 --> 00:00:33,408
跳跳公牛赛车跑道
The Bouncing Bull Racetrack!

15
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:43,340
你好
Howdy!

16
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,848
阿杰和我正在和朋友史塔拉到处竞速
AJ and I are racing around with our pal Starla!

17
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,850
我们要在蛮荒西部寻找最狂野的跑道
We're looking for the wildest ride in the wild west!

18
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:54,610
等一下 如果是那些干草捆呢
Wait! What about those - hay bales?

19
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:57,680
我觉得应该很适合跳跃
I reckon they'd make a pretty great jump!

20
00:00:58,050 --> 00:00:58,900
试试看吧
Let's try it!

21
00:00:59,180 --> 00:00:59,973
好啊
Yeah!

22
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:04,370
冲吧 牛仔们
Ride 'em cowboy!

23
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,140
太好玩了
That was great!

24
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,110
你们看
Hey! Check it out!

25
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:12,170
那颗岩石好像完美的大循环
That rock looks like a perfect loop de loop!

26
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:16,426
我们冲吧 一起大回转
C'mon, y'all! Let's give it a whirl!

27
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:30,460
好刺激哦
What a ride!

28
00:01:30,950 --> 00:01:33,246
飙速 史塔拉去哪里了
Hey Blaze, where did Starla go?

29
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:35,070
我没看到她
I don't see her.

30
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,990
史塔拉在哪里
Where's Starla?

31
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,610
找到她了
Yeah, there she is!

32
00:01:44,890 --> 00:01:47,120
刚才好刺激哦 朋友们
That was some ride, fellers?

33
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:48,500
我得说
I'll tell you,

34
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,810
应该没有更好玩的地方了
I don't see how anything could be more fun than -

35
00:01:53,985 --> 00:01:54,942
祝福你
Gesundheit!

36
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,720
你们看
Look at that!

37
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:02,152
干草堆里面藏着东西耶
There was something hidden under all that hay!

38
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,875
好像是一张旧地图
It looks like an old map!

39
00:02:05,750 --> 00:02:06,410
地图
A map?!

40
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,970
你是说 藏宝图
You mean like... a treasure map?

41
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:09,650
对啊
Yeah!

42
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,874
只是这张地图 是指着更棒的宝藏
Only this map - leads to something better than treasure.

43
00:02:13,210 --> 00:02:15,420
它指着 赛车跑道
It leads to... a racetrack!

44
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,090
那就太棒了
Well buss my bumpers!

45
00:02:18,650 --> 00:02:22,260
这个是 跳跳公牛赛车跑道
That there's... the Bouncin' Bull Racetrack!

46
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,200
听说跳跳公牛赛车跑道
They say the bouncing bull track's -

47
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:34,634
是史上最刺激 最精彩也最狂野的赛车跑道
the rootenest, tootenest, wildest racetrack that ever was!

48
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,230
所以只要跟着地图走
So all we have to do is follow this map,

49
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:40,970
我们就可以到达跳跳公牛赛车跑道
and it'll take us to the Bouncing Bull Racetrack?

50
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,280
你说对了
That's right.

51
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:46,990
可是要到那里是一趟困难的旅程
But shoo-wee, getting there is gonna be some tough journey.

52
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,610
可是我们做得到
Hey, but we can make it!

53
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,410
只要我们一起合作
As long as we stick together,

54
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:53,355
没什么能阻止我们到达那个赛车跑道
nothing can stop us from getting to that racetrack!

55
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,050
对啊
Yeah!

56
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,780
说得好 飙速
You said it, Blaze!

57
00:02:55,880 --> 00:03:00,234
走吧 伙伴们 前往跳跳公牛赛车跑道
This way, partners! To the Bouncin' Bull Racetrack!

58
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,360
轮胎冒烟
Burn rubber

59
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,960
让轮胎冒烟
Burn, burn rubber

60
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:14,120
出发 出发 出发
Let's go, let's go, let's go

61
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,210
轮胎冒烟
Burn rubber

62
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:16,860
让轮胎冒烟
Burn, burn rubber

63
00:03:17,250 --> 00:03:19,920
出发 出发 出发
Let's go, let's go, let's go

64
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,570
我们要出发
We're on our way

65
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:22,950
加速引擎
Accelerate

66
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,060
现在就增加速度
We're gaining speed

67
00:03:25,940 --> 00:03:26,960
轮胎冒烟
Burn rubber

68
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,560
让轮胎冒烟
Burn, burn rubber

69
00:03:28,810 --> 00:03:31,540
出发 出发 出发
Let's go, let's go, let's go

70
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:34,319
轮胎冒烟 出发
Burn rubber. Let's go!

71
00:03:39,610 --> 00:03:41,710
要去跳跳公牛赛车跑道
To get to the Bouncing Bull Racetrack -

72
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:44,196
我们好像要先通过
it looks like first we'll have to get past...

73
00:03:44,496 --> 00:03:45,890
巨大峭壁
the Colossal Cliff!

74
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:50,230
不知道为什么要叫巨大峭壁
Wonder why they call it a colossal cliff?

75
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:54,500
原来如此
That's why.

76
00:03:56,010 --> 00:03:58,350
对面真的很远耶
Sure is a long way to the other side.

77
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:04,640
到底是怎么回事
What in tarnation?!

78
00:04:07,210 --> 00:04:08,850
你们看这些间歇泉
Check out all those geysers!

79
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,380
它们喷出很多蒸气耶
They're really blasting a lot of steam!

80
00:04:13,265 --> 00:04:16,220
等等 间歇泉为什么会这样
Wait! How do them geysers do that?

81
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:20,166
我们来看一下 换成遮光板视野
Take a look! Switching to VisorView!

82
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,838
在地底的深处 有一池一池的热水
There are pools of hot water, deep under the ground.

83
00:04:25,150 --> 00:04:27,500
当池水加热至摄氏一百度
And when they heat up to 100 degrees Celsius,

84
00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:30,660
就会开始冒泡 然后变成蒸气
the water starts to bubble and changes into steam.

85
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,700
这就叫沸腾
That's called boiling!

86
00:04:33,730 --> 00:04:36,090
当沸腾的水制造出太多蒸气
And when the boiling water makes so much steam

87
00:04:36,090 --> 00:04:39,046
让里面空间不够
that it has nowhere to go... Kaboom!

88
00:04:39,046 --> 00:04:41,460
就会冲出地面了
It blasts up out of the ground!

89
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,294
对了 史塔拉 我有一个点子
Hey Starla. I've got an idea.

90
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:48,045
如果我们搭着从间歇泉喷出来的蒸气呢
What if we ride the steam that comes out of the geyser?

91
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:49,610
好主意
Well I'll be!

92
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:54,111
一定有哪次的喷发可以带我们飞过这个巨大峭壁
I bet one blast could carry us right across that colossal cliff.

93
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,460
来 我们看地底下
C'mon, let's look underground

94
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,500
是哪个间歇泉快要喷发了
to see which geyser's gonna blast next!

95
00:04:59,150 --> 00:05:01,360
记住 当水开始沸腾
Remember, when the water starts boiling,

96
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:04,000
就表示间歇泉就要喷发了
that means the geyser's about to blast!

97
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:08,180
仔细看 哪一池水在沸腾了
Look carefully... which pool of water is boiling?

98
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:13,040
中间那池 对了
The middle one, yeah!

99
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,790
水开始沸腾 变成蒸气了
The water's boiling, and changing to steam!

100
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:19,545
史塔拉 快点 跳到中间的间歇泉
Quick, Starla - hop on the middle geyser!

101
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,800
我来咯
Here I go!

102
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,740
我过来了
I made it!!

103
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,623
好 飙速 现在换我们跳间歇泉了
Alright, Blaze - now it's our turn to ride a geyser!

104
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:38,143
来吧 一起找哪一个会接着喷发
C'mon, let's figure out which one's gonna blast next!

105
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:42,660
仔细看 哪一池水在沸腾了
Look carefully. Which pool of water is boiling?

106
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:47,230
那一池 对了
That one, right!

107
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:48,880
它要喷发了
It's about to blast!

108
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,220
飙速 快点
Hurry, Blaze!

109
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,020
抓紧啦
Hang on!

110
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,720
好耶
Alright!

111
00:06:01,090 --> 00:06:02,590
刚才超酷的
That was awesome!

112
00:06:04,250 --> 00:06:06,520
很高兴你们跳了过来
Nice of you fellers to drop in!

113
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:09,710
走吧 我们继续走
Now, c'mon! Let's get a move on!

114
00:06:10,150 --> 00:06:10,900
好啊
Yeah!

115
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:13,930
跳跳公牛赛车跑道往这里走
This way to the Bouncing Bull Racetrack!

116
00:06:19,295 --> 00:06:22,520
沸腾 沸腾
B-b-b boiling, b-b-b boiling

117
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:25,200
现在越来越热热热
Things are heatin' up, up, up

118
00:06:25,770 --> 00:06:28,510
温度正在攀升
Temperature is on the rise

119
00:06:29,530 --> 00:06:32,050
如果达到了沸点
And if it reaches the boiling point

120
00:06:32,350 --> 00:06:35,980
就会在我们的面前发生改变
The change will happen right before our eyes

121
00:06:36,410 --> 00:06:39,140
液体很烫的时候会冒泡
When liquid gets so hot that it bubbles

122
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:42,600
就是沸腾 沸腾
It's b-b-b boiling, b-b-b boiling

123
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,680
当水煮沸就会变成开始冒泡
When water boils it changes into steam

124
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,150
这是沸腾 沸腾
B-b-b boiling, b-b-b boiling

125
00:06:49,150 --> 00:06:52,510
液体变成气体 这是物态变化
Liquid to gas, it's a change of state

126
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:56,300
要让温度一直提高
Gotta get the temperature to elevate, yeah

127
00:06:56,300 --> 00:06:59,160
当水煮沸就会变成开始冒泡
When liquid gets so hot that it bubbles

128
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:03,310
这是沸腾 沸腾
It's b-b-b boiling, b-b-b boiling

129
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:17,780
牛仔朋友
Cowboy friends! Cowboy friends!

130
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:21,940
我和克莱瑟是牛仔朋友
Me and Crusher are cowboy friends!

131
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:33,020
换你了 克莱瑟牛仔
Take it away, Cowboy Crusher!

132
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:34,820
克莱瑟
Crusher?

133
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:37,820
你看 皮克
Check it out, Pickle -

134
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,375
有菜园耶
a garden!

135
00:07:41,030 --> 00:07:43,564
我等不及要吃一根胡萝卜了
I can't wait to eat one of those carrots!

136
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:47,360
很可爱吧
Aw, isn't that cute?

137
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:50,580
胡萝卜属于那只小鸡耶
The carrots belong to that little chicken!

138
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:53,960
很快就不是了
Not for long they don't!

139
00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:02,840
我拿到一根了
I got one!

140
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:05,111
那只小鸡没办法阻止我
And there's nothing that chicken can do

141
00:08:05,111 --> 00:08:09,408
吃掉这根新鲜美味又好吃的
to stop me from eating his fresh tasty, delicious...

142
00:08:11,833 --> 00:08:13,111
蜡笔
Crayon?!

143
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,125
朋友们 然后走哪边
Fellers! Where to next?

144
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:38,780
你看 我们已经通过巨大峭壁
Check it out! We've already crossed the Colossal Cliff.

145
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:41,260
所以要去跳跳公牛赛车跑道
So to get to the Bouncing Bull Racetrack,

146
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,520
接下来要通过的地方是
the next place we have to go through is...

147
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,840
红石峡谷
the Red Rock Canyon!

148
00:08:47,270 --> 00:08:48,990
那就太棒了
Well buss my bumpers!

149
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:52,020
红石峡谷 一定就在那边
That must be Red Rock Canyon right there!

150
00:08:52,820 --> 00:08:54,390
好 大家一起来 我们走吧
Well, c'mon everyone. This way!

151
00:09:02,650 --> 00:09:04,820
红石峡谷好安静哦
Red Rock Canyon sure is quiet...

152
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,110
有点太安静了
A little too quiet...

153
00:09:08,930 --> 00:09:11,040
还有点臭耶
And kinda smelly, too!

154
00:09:14,260 --> 00:09:14,900
小心
Look out!

155
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,069
怎么回事
Tarnation!

156
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:22,500
有人一直轰炸我们 用了臭臭弹
Someone just tried to blast us with... Stinky stink!

157
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:28,300
那是 臭鼬强盗
It's... Skunk Bandits!

158
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:32,390
我们快离开这里
Let's get outta here!

159
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:44,053
小心啊
Watch out!

160
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:02,440
臭鼬强盗完全不放过我们
Those Skunk Bandits are chasing us everywhere!

161
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:04,345
该怎么躲开它们
How are we gonna away from 'em?

162
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:07,123
我有好点子 你们看上面
I've got an idea. Look up there!

163
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,100
大岩石
Big rocks!

164
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,440
可以用来封住峡谷
We can use those to block the canyon -

165
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:13,280
臭鼬就不会跟着我们了
so the Skunks can't follow us!

166
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:14,380
你们看
Check it out!

167
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,810
峡谷的这个部分是3公尺宽
This part of the canyon is 3 meters wide.

168
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,971
所以我们要刚好3公尺的岩石才能挡住臭鼬
So we need a rock that's exactly 3 meters to block the skunks!

169
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,620
要找到3公尺的岩石
To find the rock that's three meters,

170
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:27,923
寻找高度跟量尺的3一样高的岩石
look for the rock that goes up to the number 3 on the ruler.

171
00:10:28,210 --> 00:10:29,820
哪颗岩石有到达3
Which rock goes up to 3?

172
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:33,811
那颗 对了
That one, right!

173
00:10:34,130 --> 00:10:36,240
它刚好3公尺
It's exactly 3 meters!

174
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:51,667
阻止它们了
We stopped 'em!

175
00:10:56,210 --> 00:10:58,950
糟糕 还有臭鼬强盗
Hubcaps - more Skunk Bandits!

176
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:03,850
它们比刚才那群还臭耶
And they're even stinkier than the last ones!

177
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:09,467
快点 一起挡住它们 别让它们跟上来
Quick, let's block 'em, so they can't follow us, either!

178
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,420
前面的峡谷4公尺宽
The canyon up ahead is 4 meters wide.

179
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:15,540
所以我们需要4公尺长的岩石
So we need a rock that measures 4 meters!

180
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:18,540
哪颗岩石有到达4的高度
Which rock goes up to the number 4?

181
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:22,996
那颗 对了
That one, yeah!

182
00:11:25,130 --> 00:11:27,280
你们跟不上了 臭鼬
Oh no ya don't, Skunkies!

183
00:11:39,070 --> 00:11:40,010
又挡住它们了
Blocked 'em again!

184
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,450
你们看
Look!

185
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:43,277
峡谷的出口在那里
There's the end of the canyon!

186
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:53,460
这下糟了
Dagnabbit!

187
00:11:53,810 --> 00:11:57,000
最臭的臭鼬强盗出现了
Here come the stinkiestSkunk Bandit yet!

188
00:11:58,670 --> 00:12:01,517
我们要封住峡谷 阻止这些强盗
We've gotta block the canyon, and stop that bandit!

189
00:12:02,930 --> 00:12:05,050
峡谷的出口有7公尺宽
The end of the canyon is 7 meters wide.

190
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:08,210
这里有哪颗石头到达数字7
Which rock goes to the number 7?

191
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,293
这颗 它的尺寸刚刚好
That one! It's just the right size!

192
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,790
再会啦 臭鼬强盗
So long, Skunk Bandits!

193
00:12:27,250 --> 00:12:30,430
跳跳公牛赛车跑道 我们来了
Bouncin' Bull Racetrack, here we come!

194
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:48,240
他想要拿胡萝卜
He tried to take a carrot

195
00:12:48,490 --> 00:12:50,320
看起来成熟可以摘了
It looked ripe for the pickin'!

196
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:52,200
可是他被对手骗了
But then he was outsmarted

197
00:12:52,410 --> 00:12:54,050
是小小的农夫鸡
By a little farmer chicken!

198
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:01,400
那只鸡以为我拿不到他的胡萝卜
That chicken thinks I can't get his carrot...

199
00:13:01,860 --> 00:13:04,180
他完全想错了
but he is so wrong!

200
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:07,757
你看 他离开了
Look! He's walking away!

201
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:09,660
我的机会来了
Now's my chance!

202
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:18,284
成功了 我拿到了
It worked! I got it!

203
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:22,300
可惜那只小鸡不知道
Too bad that little chicken has no idea

204
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:25,614
我就要吃掉他成熟多汁的
I'm about to eat his big, ripe, juicy...

205
00:13:26,639 --> 00:13:28,046
三角锥
Road cone?!

206
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:38,720
你们看
Check it out!

207
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:42,176
我们离跳跳公牛赛车跑道已经很近了
We're getting super close to the Bouncing Bull Racetrack!

208
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,661
现在剩下的
All we have left to do

209
00:13:43,661 --> 00:13:46,336
就是沿着生锈铁路走 就到了
is follow the tracks of the Rusty Railroad!

210
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:50,300
这附近应该会有生锈铁路才对
There must be some Railroad Tracks around here somewhere.

211
00:13:51,490 --> 00:13:53,300
你有看到生锈铁路的轨道吗
Where do you see Railroad Tracks?

212
00:13:56,620 --> 00:13:57,970
看到了
Yeah, there they are!

213
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:01,450
生锈铁路好像穿过那个旧隧道耶
Looks like the Rusty Railroad goes through that old tunnel!

214
00:14:02,220 --> 00:14:03,280
跟我来 朋友们
This way, fellers!

215
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:13,520
我来帮你 史塔拉
I gotcha, Starla!

216
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,150
谢谢你 飙速
Thanks, Blaze.

217
00:14:19,490 --> 00:14:20,420
刚才好险哦
That was close!

218
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,930
现在该怎么办
So what do we do now?

219
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:26,383
如果想开过这条旧轨道
If we try to drive on these old train track rails,

220
00:14:26,458 --> 00:14:27,627
我们会掉下去
we'll fall off!

221
00:14:28,780 --> 00:14:31,090
这些轨道不是为怪兽车打造的
These rails weren't made for Monster Machines.

222
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,370
要走这条路
To ride on them,

223
00:14:32,370 --> 00:14:34,410
我们需要 蒸汽引擎
we need... a Steam Engine!

224
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:38,900
对耶 蒸汽引擎就是使用沸腾力量的火车
Yeah! Steam Engines are trains that use the power of boiling!

225
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:42,150
里面有燃烧炉可以加热一锅水
They have a firebox inside that heats up a tank of water

226
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:44,830
一直到达100度
until it reaches 100 degrees.

227
00:14:45,410 --> 00:14:49,380
然后沸水的蒸气 会推动活塞
Then, steam from the boiling water pushes against pistons

228
00:14:49,620 --> 00:14:50,840
让火车开始前进
so the train can drive!

229
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:57,115
让我们做出蒸汽引擎 通过这段轨道吧
Let's make a steam engine and ride these rails!

230
00:14:59,450 --> 00:15:01,080
首先 我们需要燃烧炉
First, we need a fire box.

231
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:03,090
这是把水加热的部分
That's the part that heats the water!

232
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:06,680
要做出燃烧炉 就说 燃烧炉
To make the fire box, say: Fire box!

233
00:15:07,350 --> 00:15:08,480
燃烧炉
Fire box!

234
00:15:10,170 --> 00:15:11,400
然后需要锅炉
Next, we need the boiler.

235
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:14,400
就是用来放滚水的水缸
That's the tank that holds all the boiling water.

236
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:17,540
要做出锅炉 就说 锅炉
To make the boiler, say: Boiler!

237
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:19,250
锅炉
Boiler!

238
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:23,375
很好 然后只需要活塞
Great! Now all we need are the pistons.

239
00:15:23,910 --> 00:15:26,260
当滚水变成了蒸气
When the boiling water changes into steam,

240
00:15:26,610 --> 00:15:29,640
就会推动活塞让火车前进
it pushes the pistons to make the train go!

241
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:32,930
要做出活塞就说 活塞
To make the pistons, say: Pistons!

242
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,620
活塞
Pistons!

243
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:42,216
太棒了 我变成了蒸气火车怪兽机器
Oh, yeah! I'm a Steam Engine Monster Machine!

244
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:47,840
全部上车
All aboard!

245
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,290
全速蒸气前进
Full steam ahead!

246
00:15:53,610 --> 00:15:55,310
我们回到正轨了
Now we're back on track!

247
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:03,750
飙速 小心啊
Blaze, watch out!

248
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:06,220
前面的铁轨分成两条
The rails split up ahead!

249
00:16:06,500 --> 00:16:08,680
其中一条通往死路
And one way leads to a dead-end!

250
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:11,680
快点 帮我选应该走哪条路
Quick, help me choose which way to go!

251
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:15,355
我们该走下面的路 还是上面的路
Should we take the the bottom path or top path?

252
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:19,280
上面的路 很好
The top path, yeah!

253
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:21,800
太棒了
Alright!

254
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:24,640
好耶
Yeah-hea!

255
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,660
我们做对选择了
We made the right choice!

256
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:30,026
大家小心 前面又有叉路了
But careful, y'all: here comes another split!

257
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:33,930
我们该走上面的路 还是下面的路
Should we take  the bottom path or the top path?

258
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,540
下面的路 很好
The bottom path, right!

259
00:16:42,170 --> 00:16:43,180
做得很好 飙速
Good going, Blaze!

260
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,650
我们快出去了
We're almost out of here!

261
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:46,980
前面只剩一条叉路
There's just one more split up ahead!

262
00:16:48,050 --> 00:16:50,762
我们该走上面的路 还是下面的路
Should we take the top path, or the bottom path?

263
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,620
上面的路 很好
The top path, yeah!

264
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,890
我们走完生锈铁路了
We made it to the end of the Rusty Railroad!

265
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:12,190
下一站 跳跳公牛赛车跑道
Next stop: the Bouncing Bull Racetrack!

266
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,920
完全不愿意分享
Instead of asking to share it

267
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:27,580
克莱瑟想要偷走胡萝卜
Crusher's trying to steal the carrot!

268
00:17:40,060 --> 00:17:41,300
鸡又要离开了
The chicken's leaving again!

269
00:17:41,710 --> 00:17:45,454
也就是说 我终于要拿到胡萝卜了
That means... I'm finally gonna get that carrot!

270
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:48,060
很好
Oh yeah!

271
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,870
快来克莱瑟身边
Come to Crusher!

272
00:17:51,020 --> 00:17:52,120
它是我的了
It's mine now!

273
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:54,720
完全没有 我说完全没有
And there's nothing - I mean nothing-

274
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:56,260
那只鸡没办法阻止我
that chicken can do to stop me

275
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:59,605
吃掉美味又多汁的 橘色的
from eating this nice juicy, orange...

276
00:18:02,005 --> 00:18:02,964
鞋子
Shoe?!!

277
00:18:17,915 --> 00:18:19,573
你们快看前面
Would ya look at that!

278
00:18:19,910 --> 00:18:22,420
那是 跳跳公牛赛车跑道
It's... the Bouncing Bull Racetrack!

279
00:18:24,510 --> 00:18:25,500
我们要怎么上去
How are we gonna get up there?

280
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:29,177
你们看 另一个间歇泉
Hey, look - another geyser!

281
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:33,560
太完美了
That's perfect!

282
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:37,715
我们可以坐间歇泉的蒸气跳上那个赛车跑道
We can ride that geyser's steam right up to the racetrack!

283
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:42,270
你们有闻到什么吗
Do you guys smell something?

284
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:46,227
有耶 很臭的气味
Yeah. Something stinky.

285
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,480
难道会是
You don't think it could be...

286
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:53,220
臭鼬强盗
Skunk Bandits!

287
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,785
快点 冲向间歇泉
Quick! Head for the geyser!

288
00:19:00,655 --> 00:19:01,395
小心
Look out!

289
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:06,370
那些小臭鼬紧跟在后面
Those little stinkers are right behind us!

290
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:08,100
我们该怎么逃走
How're we gonna out run 'em?

291
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:11,460
看来应该要用飙风速度了
Sounds like it's time to use some Blazing Speed!

292
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:21,761
要给我们飙风速度 就说一起飙速
To give us Blazing Speed, say: Let's Blaze!

293
00:19:22,490 --> 00:19:25,330
一起飙速
Let's Blaze!

294
00:19:48,865 --> 00:19:49,785
太好了
Alright!

295
00:19:49,785 --> 00:19:50,645
我们成功了
We made it!/

296
00:19:52,610 --> 00:19:54,200
这里太棒了
Hoppin' Hubcaps!

297
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:58,835
我们到了 跳跳公牛赛车跑道
There it is - the Bouncin' Bull Racetrack!

298
00:20:04,065 --> 00:20:07,880
看来只剩下一件事要做了
Well, looks like there's only one thing left to do.

299
00:20:08,370 --> 00:20:09,450
什么事 史塔拉
What's that, Starla?

300
00:20:10,450 --> 00:20:12,600
往前冲吧 牛仔
Ride 'em cowboy!

301
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:17,470
预备
Ready...

302
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:18,310
就位
Set...

303
00:20:18,870 --> 00:20:20,060
出发
Ride!

304
00:21:04,210 --> 00:21:08,070
这条跳跳公牛赛车跑道好疯狂哦
This Bouncing Bull Racetrack is one crazy ride!

305
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:09,500
你说对了
You said it!

306
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:13,880
这是蛮荒西部最狂野的跑道了
It's the wildest track in the wild west!

307
00:21:30,962 --> 00:21:33,778
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

308
00:21:33,778 --> 00:21:36,442
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

309
00:21:36,442 --> 00:21:37,882
系上了安全带
Buckle up gonna roll

310
00:21:37,882 --> 00:21:39,362
准备好要出发
Yeah, we're ready to go

311
00:21:39,362 --> 00:21:41,946
有飙速就有惊喜
With Blaze You'll be amazed

312
00:21:42,242 --> 00:21:45,042
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

313
00:21:45,042 --> 00:21:47,762
极速 冒险不断前进
It's time for adventure extreme

314
00:21:47,762 --> 00:21:49,202
全力加速冲刺
Gonna kick it in gear

315
00:21:49,202 --> 00:21:50,642
享受完美速度
We'll be catching some air

316
00:21:50,642 --> 00:21:54,322
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

317
00:21:54,322 --> 00:21:55,522
飙速
Blaze!

